{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港迪士尼樂園發生盜竊案。據了解，昨日（27日）晚上11時許，警方接獲報案指，一名年約30歲男子涉嫌在園內店舖偷取100隻商品，包括公仔和鎖匙扣，警員接報到場，以涉嫌「盜竊」罪名拘捕涉案男子，案件交由大嶼山警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港迪士尼樂園。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203176614033100800398026.jpeg/nGZFL1NtBVSxHO4l3vYLme4xqAV9AX8C6P-3I-j_tyM\"/><figcaption>香港迪士尼樂園。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T19:04:20.151727+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:47:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:17:54.933859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:57:48.757936+00:00","content_hash":"b02eeb42b8a4dba53367f446a1f67b7dd1b80a28a89bb1edc5ce4eef0a0f4a25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}